   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Give an opinion",
   "texto": [
    "**Synes** already appears at the previous level to express a personal opinion. **Jeg tror** usually expresses what one believes or expects to be true. In Spanish, «creo» can serve both senses."
   ]
