  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Show agreement",
   "texto": [
    "**Enig** means «All right.»; **uenig**, «en desacuerdo». To ease the disagreement, you can say **Jeg er ikke helt enig** («I do not fully agree.»)."
   ]
